# Mute forward compatibility warnings.
# See: https://github.com/consolidation/config/issues/61 and other similar.
%Method "[^"]+" might add "[^"]+" as a native return type declaration in the future. Do the same in (child class|implementation) "[^"]+" now to avoid errors or add an explicit @return annotation to suppress this message%

# TODO: Remove in Drupal 11.
%Renderer::renderPlain\(\) is deprecated in drupal:10.3.0 and is removed from drupal:12.0.0. Instead, you should use ::renderInIsolation\(\). See https://www.drupal.org/node/3407994%

%Since twig/twig 3.12: Getting node "[^"]*" on a "[^"]*" class is deprecated.%
